target: internal/evidence/evidence.go
verify: go test ./internal/evidence/ -count=1 -run 'TestPendingIDsListsOnlyWhatPendingPathBuilds'
expect: want a,b
why:    `looper record pending` is Step 0c's worklist, and each id it yields is handed back to PendingPath. A filename whose id PendingPath would refuse was not written by pr-report, so it is not a report to post; listing it hands Step 0c a path no writer could have built.
--- old
		if ValidRunID(id) {
			ids = append(ids, id)
		}
--- new
		ids = append(ids, id)
